@startuml booking-states
title Booking state machine
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Proposed
Proposed --> AwaitingApproval : user selects items
AwaitingApproval --> Declined : user declines
AwaitingApproval --> CapacityCheck : user approves
CapacityCheck --> Confirmed : capacity ok
CapacityCheck --> Proposed : lounge full, re-recommend
CapacityCheck --> Failed : tool error
Failed --> CapacityCheck : retry (max 2)
Failed --> AskUser : retries exhausted
Confirmed --> Confirmed : duplicate confirmation ignored
Declined --> [*]
Confirmed --> [*]
AskUser --> [*]
@enduml